  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【伊豆・修善寺】国の登録有形文化財「新井旅館」宿泊ガイド！名建築・天平大浴堂と竹林の小径</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">芥川龍之介や横山大観ら多くの文人墨客に愛された修善寺の老舗「新井旅館」。四季折々に表情を変える美しい日本庭園と、歴史の薫り漂う荘厳な温泉建築で極上の休日をお過ごしください。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/31865/31865.jpg\" alt=\"修善寺温泉　国の登録文化財の宿　新井旅館\" class=\"w-full md:w-48 h-36 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold text-[10px] rounded-full\">特選おすすめ</span>\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-base leading-snug\">修善寺温泉　国の登録文化財の宿　新井旅館</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">静岡県伊豆市修善寺970 ｜ 伊豆箱根鉄道線 修善寺駅よりバスまたはタクシーで10分／東名・新東名高速 沼津ICより伊豆縦貫道経由45分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-1\">\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">⭐ 4.67（265件の評価）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1名目安: ¥22,880〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-amber-50/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-100\">ミシュランで二つ星の竹林の小径まで徒歩2分、修善寺温泉の中心で観光に便利です</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-2\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D31865\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-4 bg-amber-50/50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200\">\n  <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xs text-amber-950 mb-2\">📌 あわせて読みたい関連旅行ガイド</h4>\n  <ul class=\"text-xs text-amber-900 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside\">\n    <li><a href=\"/posts/shizuoka-onsen-ranking-hotels-guide\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\">熱海・伊東・修善寺のおすすめ温泉宿特集</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"/posts/shizuoka-famous-things-gourmet-spots-guide\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\">静岡県の特産品・地酒・名門宿ガイド</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D31865\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n    🛎️ 【公式楽天トラベル】修善寺温泉　国の登録文化財の宿　新井旅館の限定クーポン＆空室を見る\n  </a>\n</div>"
